Built with Meta Llama 3.

The `motion/*.f32` files are text-prompt embeddings for Kimodo (4096 floats each). They are the output of
an LLM2Vec encoder based on Meta Llama 3 (chibifire/Llama-3-Kimodo-GGML). The encoder and the Llama 3 model
are not in this repository. The Meta Llama 3 Community License is in `LICENSES/llama3.LICENSE`.
Meta Llama 3 is licensed under the Meta Llama 3 Community License, Copyright (c) Meta Platforms, Inc. All Rights Reserved.

The default avatar, `avatar/maro/MarocchinoLP.fbx` and its texture, is "Marocchino" (Maro), a free original 3D model by
Mohka Noir (https://twitter.com/MohkaNoir, https://cafemohka.booth.pm/), under the Apache-2.0 licence. The source is
https://github.com/chibifire-stages/character-marocchino at commit dcd38ff7f6f2ea10a584dca383a6b7c3fab27d36. The licence
file, the author's licence summary and full licence text are in `avatar/maro/` unchanged. The author prohibits using
the model for slanderous purposes or in offensive contexts, for example hate speech.
The engine, libraries, guest programs and motion clips the app holds, and their licences, are listed in `THIRD-PARTY.md`.
